# Authored (not Wiki: no journal transcript for Zogre Flesh Eaters) in OSRS journal style from the Wiki walkthrough; steps pinned to the quest varbit `zogre` stages (ZogreFleshEaters.kt).
before	<col=000080>I can start this quest by talking to <col=800000>Grish</col> at <col=800000>Jiggig</col>, south of <col=800000>Castle Wars</col>.</col>
